  "details": "I am writing to report an issue encountered during the age verification process for my VRC+ subscription account. While completing the verification steps through your partnered agency \"Persona,\" I was forced to exit the process unexpectedly at the final stage due to [ technical glitch, connectivity issue, etc.]. As a result, my account was incorrectly flagged as under 18, even though I am legally an adult.  \n\nAccording to your official announcements, the verification system retains only the user’s birthdate after successful authentication, with all other data immediately deleted. However, the incomplete submission appears to have caused an error in my account’s age classification. This now restricts my access to age-restricted maps (e.g., virtual bars) and limits my ability to fully engage in roleplay (RP) experiences designed for adult users.  \n\n**I kindly request:**  \n\n1. A reset of my age verification status to allow reprocessing.  \n\n2. Guidance on re-initiating the verification via Persona to ensure accurate age confirmation.  \n\nI am willing to resubmit my government-issued ID and real-time facial recognition data to resolve this issue promptly. Please let me know if additional information is required.  \n\nThank you for your dedication to creating a safe and inclusive virtual community. I appreciate your urgent attention to this matter.",
